WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
I don’t know if she is really asleep or pretending to sleep.

2
00:00:02,520 --> 00:00:03,680
If it's the former

3
00:00:03,880 --> 00:00:05,680
Someone made a request, but I didn’t hear it or wake up.

4
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:06,800
Isn't it the default

5
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,030
Breathe evenly

6
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,630
This is sleeping

7
00:00:10,950 --> 00:00:12,500
God is really helping me

8
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,380
The opportunity to be strong is right in front of you

9
00:00:14,700 --> 00:00:15,900
Just take her out of the car

10
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:17,660
She belongs to my food

11
00:00:18,820 --> 00:00:20,700
Can you get off with me at the next stop?

12
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,490
Only time passes

13
00:00:23,690 --> 00:00:25,530
If she didn't answer, she would be acquiescing.

14
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,620
Why didn’t the Rou family reply?

15
00:00:27,860 --> 00:00:29,260
You can't really fall asleep, right?

16
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,900
The Rou family had to do something to save themselves.

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:33,700
But you can't yell

18
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:35,640
What is this player waiting for?

19
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:38,280
The Feng Shui Cemetery Station has arrived

20
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:43,670
Passengers who want to get off please get off through the rear door. Who are you?

21
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:48,370
Where are you now?

22
00:00:48,370 --> 00:00:49,850
There are still two stops before we can get off the train.

23
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:54,430
How did you get rid of me?

24
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:57,330
You have to come with me. You are sick.

25
00:00:57,410 --> 00:00:59,770
A strong and charming woman can have sex in broad daylight

26
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:01,650
If she dares to do anything again, I will call the police.

27
00:01:01,690 --> 00:01:04,380
Why do rule-breaking humans not abide by the rules?

28
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:06,300
If the player cannot ignore the rules

29
00:01:06,420 --> 00:01:08,160
Are you really a player?
